OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a mainly dry day
OL,6,Fwith sunny intervals, though there
OL,7,Fcould still be the odd light shower at
OL,8,Ffirst. Moderate occasionally fresh
OL,9,Feast or northeasterly wind.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FIt will be a dry evening and
OL,12,Fnight with broken cloud and some clear
OL,13,Fspells. Winds will turn lighter
OL,14,Fovernight.
OL,15,
OL,16,CMonday:FIt will be a fine dry day with
OL,17,Fplenty of sunshine across all areas.
OL,18,FLight to moderate southeasterly breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
