OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FSunny
OL,6,Fintervals and showers on Tuesday with
OL,7,Fstrong southeasterly winds. Cloudy
OL,8,Fwith occasional rain on Wednesday then
OL,9,Fbrighter with showers again on
OL,10,FThursday.
